results.</p></div></article><article class="card sl-flex astro-ibyrjz76"><p class="title sl-flex astro-ibyrjz76"><svg aria-hidden="true" class="icon astro-ibyrjz76 astro-buixqtin" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor" style="--sl-icon-size: 1.333em;"><path d="M18.71 7.21a1 1 0 0 0-1.42 0l-7.45 7.46-3.13-3.14A1.02 1.02 0 1 0 5.29 13l3.84 3.84a1.001 1.001 0 0 0 1.42 0l8.16-8.16a1 1 0 0 0 0-1.47Z"/></svg><span class="astro-ibyrjz76">Battle-tested</span></p><div class="body astro-ibyrjz76"><p><a href="https://npmx.dev/package/knip">86M downloads/month</a> and <a href="https://github.com/webpro-nl/knip/network/dependents">over 21.000 public projects</a> are using
Knip!</p></div></article><article class="card sl-flex astro-ibyrjz76"><p class="title sl-flex astro-ibyrjz76"><svg aria-hidden="true" class="icon astro-ibyrjz76 astro-buixqtin" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor" style="--sl-icon-size: 1.333em;"><path d="M21.17 2.06A13.1 13.1 0 0 0 19 1.87a12.94 12.94 0 0 0-7 2.05 12.94 12.94 0 0 0-7-2 13.1 13.1 0 0 0-2.17.19 1 1 0 0 0-.83 1v12a1 1 0 0 0 1.17 1 10.9 10.9 0 0 1 8.25 1.91l.12.07h.11a.91.91 0 0 0 .7 0h.11l.12-.07A10.899 10.899 0 0 1 20.83 16 1 1 0 0 0 22 15V3a1 1 0 0 0-.83-.94ZM11 15.35a12.87 12.87 0 0 0-6-1.48H4v-10c.333-.02.667-.02 1 0a10.86 10.86 0 0 1 6 1.8v9.68Zm9-1.44h-1a12.87 12.87 0 0 0-6 1.48V5.67a10.86 10.86 0 0 1 6-1.8c.333-.02.667-.02 1 0v10.04Zm1.17 4.15a13.098 13.098 0 0 0-2.17-.19 12.94 12.94 0 0 0-7 2.05 12.94 12.94 0 0 0-7-2.05c-.727.003-1.453.066-2.17.19A1 1 0 0 0 2 19.21a1 1 0 0 0 1.17.79 10.9 10.9 0 0 1 8.25 1.91 1 1 0 0 0 1.16 0A10.9 10.9 0 0 1 20.83 20a1 1 0 0 0 1.17-.79 1 1 0 0 0-.83-1.15Z"/></svg><span class="astro-ibyrjz76">Plugins</span></p><div class="body astro-ibyrjz76"><p>Knip comes with <a href="./reference/plugins">over 200 plugins</a> for tools and frameworks like Astro,
